wing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-30T09:56:49Z","updated_at":"2026-08-30T10:03:45Z","body":"The issue is that `EditorNode` dialogs don't have autowrapping, which is a problem because `ScriptCreateDialog` can include the script path in the message, so it can be any size, even larger than what can fit on the screen:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"219\" alt=\"Snímek obrazovky 2026-08-24 111121\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e1bac1c8-e50f-41ef-977e-c08f1c865f6a\" />\r\n\r\nIt's probably the reason why it´s implemented like this in the `ScriptCreateDialog` and all the other ones.\r\n\r\nThey should probably still be converted to `EditorNode::show_warning()`, but that issue above needs to be fixed first, and I didn't find a non-hacky way to do it.\r\n\r\nEDIT: yea and btw if you were to change them please make them non resizable, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117849 did that, but it missed like half of the dialogs in the codebase, including `EditorNode.warning`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5468005619/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]